{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mr. Chuckles\u2019 Park</strong> is a psychological horror game set in <strong>1993</strong>. You explore an old, abandoned amusement park. It was once full of fun rides and happy families, but now it is silent, creepy and dangerous.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a character sent to the park on a secret mission to find out what happened there. The park\u2019s\u00a0robotic mascot, <strong>Mr. Chuckles</strong>, was once loved by children, but after a strange event the park was closed and people who entered never came back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you explore the park, strange things start to happen. Mr. Chuckles, who everyone thought was gone, is still here and he is <strong>watching you.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mr. Chuckles\u2019 AI is very unpredictable.</strong> Sometimes you will meet a normal mascot who does nothing if you get close. But if you meet the real Mr. Chuckles, even if he looks harmless and just stands there, it could be your end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>He can chase you, follow you quietly or wait for you in the dark. You never know when or where he will appear.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The park is full of dark corners, secret paths and scary attractions. Some of them still work. You can ride the roller coaster to find hidden places or try the carousel and feel the old joy of the park again\u2026 until Mr. Chuckles finds you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Main Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A scary abandoned park full of secrets and danger</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Working rides like roller coasters, carousels and hidden areas</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Mr. Chuckles, the robotic mascot who never stops watching</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Every game is different with new puzzles, areas and layouts</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4116470?t=1762190704","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4116470/433bb43e4ad64269d5aa0889b45a8ece6e21fc12/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762190704","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4116470/f31f09f47d52fad478210abd281db5f1318e7498/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762190704","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4116470/f31f09f47d52fad478210abd281db5f1318e7498/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762190704","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mr. Chuckles\u2019 Park</strong> is a psychological horror game set in <strong>1993</strong>. You explore an old, abandoned amusement park. It was once full of fun rides and happy families, but now it is silent, creepy and dangerous.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a character sent to the park on a secret mission to find out what happened there. The park\u2019s\u00a0robotic mascot, <strong>Mr. Chuckles</strong>, was once loved by children, but after a strange event the park was closed and people who entered never came back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you explore the park, strange things start to happen. Mr. Chuckles, who everyone thought was gone, is still here and he is <strong>watching you.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mr. Chuckles\u2019 AI is very unpredictable.</strong> Sometimes you will meet a normal mascot who does nothing if you get close. But if you meet the real Mr. Chuckles, even if he looks harmless and just stands there, it could be your end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>He can chase you, follow you quietly or wait for you in the dark. You never know when or where he will appear.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The park is full of dark corners, secret paths and scary attractions. Some of them still work. You can ride the roller coaster to find hidden places or try the carousel and feel the old joy of the park again\u2026 until Mr. Chuckles finds you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Main Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A scary abandoned park full of secrets and danger</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Working rides like roller coasters, carousels and hidden areas</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Mr. Chuckles, the robotic mascot who never stops watching</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Every game is different with new puzzles, areas and layouts</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Entity DynamiX"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4116470/4556b8cf31c04066dac24068f301d9c6e179a0bc/header.jpg?t=1762190704","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4116470/480001022/2e9be23e6c9b33fb53f2dbf9902aebf9d86447d3/1761580809/dash_av1.mpd?t=1762190702","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4116470/480001022/2e9be23e6c9b33fb53f2dbf9902aebf9d86447d3/1761580809/dash_h264.mpd?t=1762190702","highligh